    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARIA: I'm Maria. This is Blanca.\nBLANCA: Oh my god.",
      "BLANCA: ... OK.\nMARIA: Juan, I want to dance.\nMARIA: What's wrong with you?",
      "JUANA: I don't understand. You're going all the way to Chiquinquira? To work as a secretary?\nMARIA: I already told you ...\nJUANA: Well tell me again.\nMARIA: I got it through Blanca's aunt.",
      "MARIA: I didn't know you were going again.\nLUCY: I didn't either. It just happened.\nMARIA: You know we're not the only ones.\nLUCY: That's how it works. They send a bunch of us so if one gets stopped it makes it easier for the rest to slip through ...",
      "LUCY: I don't feel well.\nMARIA: What are you going to do?\nMARIA: Calm down. As soon as we arrive we're going to get you to a doctor. You're going to be fine.\nLUCY: I know. I know. Thanks."
    ]
  },
